Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.60,0:01:59.91,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Yes！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.25,0:01:59.57,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Pretty cu·cu·cu·cure
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.37,0:02:02.71,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Yes！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.70,0:02:02.41,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Everybody Yes, fight！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.54,0:02:05.05,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,心跳不已  开怀欢笑
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.26,0:02:07.69,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Smile go go！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.76,0:02:08.58,OP＆ED,,0,0,35,,Precure~！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.48,0:02:12.39,OP＆ED,,0,0,35,,Yes！P·re·cu·re·5！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.58,0:02:16.85,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,长大后想做什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.40,0:02:19.14,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,想·做·想做·什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.15,0:02:21.91,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,想亲手尝试的事有很多！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.96,0:02:24.14,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,很・多・都・想・做！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.41,0:02:29.12,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,哭鼻子是不能解决问题的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.33,0:02:33.31,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,用心中的橡皮拭去眼泪吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.11,0:02:38.45,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Go！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.89,0:02:38.11,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Metamorphose！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.25,0:02:42.74,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,为梦想而生
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.54,0:02:41.88,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,One！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.22,0:02:42.57,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Two！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.94,0:02:43.75,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Three！Four！Five！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.97,0:02:48.09,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,飞翔吧 努力的女孩
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.11,0:02:47.37,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Five！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.68,0:02:48.02,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Four！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.42,0:02:49.30,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Three！Two！One！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.35,0:02:53.81,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,未来不是只论成败
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.14,0:02:57.24,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,描绘自己的明天吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.82,0:02:59.11,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Go！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.94,0:03:00.42,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,GoGo！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.14,0:03:03.07,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Go Go Go Go！Yes！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.48,0:03:02.03,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,转危为机 坚强地变身！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.60,0:03:06.00,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Yes！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.07,0:03:05.84,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Pretty cu·cu·cu·cure
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.34,0:03:08.71,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Yes！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.84,0:03:08.28,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Everybody Yes, Huslte！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.43,0:03:11.03,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,心跳不已  喜笑颜开
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.12,0:03:13.62,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Smile go go！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.77,0:03:14.11,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Go！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.97,0:03:15.42,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Yes！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.66,0:03:19.00,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,1. 2. 3. 4 Precure（5!）
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default CN,,0,0,0,,ED
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.87,0:22:16.86,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,想要做梦 想要恋爱
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.86,0:22:19.61,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,想做很多事情
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.87,0:22:22.45,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,微笑就是咒語
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.45,0:22:26.17,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Pre pre precure·Five☆
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.80,0:22:28.63,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Yeah~！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.22,0:22:39.10,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,像椰子和果仁那般
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.10,0:22:41.05,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,柔軟甜美的吻
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.27,0:22:45.06,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,沉醉其中时
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.06,0:22:47.30,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,闹钟响了起来
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.40,0:22:50.39,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,得把窗帘打开
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.91,0:22:53.39,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,去寻找梦的续集
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.95,0:22:57.03,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,希望那灿烂的阳光
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.03,0:22:59.27,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,不要把我的心溶化
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.91,0:23:00.62,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Oh～！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.62,0:23:06.36,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,太阳公公的表情多么开朗
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.63,0:23:12.38,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,为何可以笑得这么开怀!?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.60,0:23:18.23,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,其实我的心情也是同样明亮的 color
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.23,0:23:23.27,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,闪闪发亮吧 My True Love！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.32,0:23:28.27,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,想要做梦 想要恋爱
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.27,0:23:31.06,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,想做很多事情
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.15,0:23:33.44,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,微笑就是咒语
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.70,0:23:35.16,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,可爱！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.16,0:23:36.71,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,最棒！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.71,0:23:40.02,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Pre pre precure·Five☆
